						],
						"pointId": 340100213
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 240050201,
					"content": "Wow... I'd just love to jump in and tread water or use the fountain to take a bath!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verut"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050202,
					"content": "And that'll get you scolded for sure. Just watch it from outside, please.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aurele"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050203,
					"content": "But if the fountains aren't for people to play in, then why are they so big?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verut"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050204,
					"content": "They might look nice, but if you can only look at them, then they're just pools of ordinary water. Nothing to them!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verut"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050205,
					"content": "This is no ordinary fountain, you know. But... Wait, my dad did mention those ordinary fountains... What was it that he said again...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lovi"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050206,
					"content": "\"The main purpose of city beautification projects in the Court of Fontaine is to solve tax declaration issues in a flexible fashion.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aurele"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050207,
					"content": "Mr. Delerue was explaining this to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aurele"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050208,
					"content": "Hah, you even sounded like my father back there. No wonder he likes you, Aurele. I mean, he always takes that stack of books with him when he talks to you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lovi"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050209,
					"content": "I didn't understand a word of that, but I bet my brother's killing the mood again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verut"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050210,
					"content": "Lovi, let's find another place to play. I mean, you don't have to study today for once, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verut"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050211,
					"content": "Alright, let's go see some other places. Let me think... The Steambird should still be open. Let's go over there!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lovi"
				}
			]
		},
